         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <opener>
               <dateline rend="right">
                  <date>6. X. 911</date>
               </dateline>
            </opener>
            <p>
               <salute>Herzliche Grüße!</salute> Ich bin hier ſeit <date>So<c rendition="#gemination-n"/>tag</date>
      bei <rs type="person" ref="#pmb2173">Olga</rs>, der es ſchon <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L04517-1"/>viel viel
               beſſer<note type="commentary" corresp="K_L04517-1">
                  <rs type="person" ref="#pmb2173">Olga Schnitzler</rs> litt an einem Katarrh, <ref type="schnitzler-tagebuch" target="1911-09-30" subtype="cf"/>.</note> geht, fahre <date>So<c rendition="#gemination-n"/>tag</date> wieder
               hinein. <rs type="person" ref="#pmb2173">Olga</rs> wird zur <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L04517-2"/>
               <rs type="event" ref="#pmb88534" subtype="implied">Premiere</rs>
               <note type="commentary" corresp="K_L04517-2">
                  <ref type="schnitzler-kultur" target="pmb88534"/>.</note>
      wahrſcheinlich auch ſchon in <rs type="place" ref="#pmb50">Wien</rs>
      ſein. Auf Wiederſehn.<lb/>Ihr <signed>A.</signed>
            </p>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="2">
            <p rend="right">
               <handShift scribe="#pmb2173"/>Ihre <signed>O. S.</signed>
            </p>
         </div>
      </body>
